8b577a4e4bdbb2345f21c9b698a906422fbf175b66f993e1f43481c02aa9","chunkNo":0,"startOffset":0,"endOffset":195,"text":"这是项目原创的通用策略笔记，不是当前热门阵容榜单。先确定游戏、单打或双打、允许的规则，再确定核心成员承担的角色。检查队伍是否过度集中在同一弱点，是否缺少速度控制、耐久支点或可靠输出。属性覆盖只是第一步，必须结合招式、特性、道具、努力值与轮转机会。双打还要考虑队友协同与范围招式。没有使用率或赛事证据时，不宣称某套阵容是当前最强。建议给出至少一个替换方向，并解释该替换改善了什么、牺牲了什么。","contentHash":"sha256:88e9cc038dee345a04f64543e8a95ec386e6a7a72258ac167ee9e3d251bd7a78"}},{"document":{"id":"status-moves-and-output-v1","title":"变化招式、伤害区间与击倒判断","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"变化招式 辅助 招式 威力 区间 百分比 击倒 秒杀 胜率 Status","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","content":"本地伤害桥接遇到引擎分类为Status的变化招式时，会拒绝生成直接伤害区间。这不表示该招式没有战术价值，只表示当前请求不能用直接伤害数值回答。用户想比较控制、回复或其他非直接伤害效果时，需要相应机制资料及对局条件；不能把伤害接口的拒绝解释成该招式无用，也不能虚构一个伤害百分比。\n\n对能计算的攻击招式，结果包括最小和最大伤害、目标满HP与对应百分比。解读时应同时保留范围和假设，而不是只挑最大值宣称稳定击倒。区间不等于胜率，单次对局计算也不证明整队强度。遇到工具失败、未知名称或未支持条件时，应分别指出失败原因，并说明哪部分结论尚无数值依据。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"Smogon damage-calc项目接口说明","publisher":"Smogon damage-calc contributors","url":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"ENGINE_INTERFACE_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"tools/pokemon-engine/calculate.cjs","sha256":"90e080660f1f4f65062358728d8448143a16e82adc148bcabc014af4512f3358"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["damage","resource"]}},"score":2157,"checksum":"sha256:0fe8e773449f2cfe4f1435b603b94eea0715b8ae60636621be517b07c87210d5","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-94a3ce2d28840e725b8873b9a9e6c91ee1b00ab19863a8bc6d8946ef917e9290","documentVersion":"sha256:d648a36f7db97d2bf4881cdb580781320b947b145b778d982f1f2469e97eacd9","chunkNo":0,"startOffset":0,"endOffset":139,"text":"本地伤害桥接遇到引擎分类为Status的变化招式时，会拒绝生成直接伤害区间。这不表示该招式没有战术价值，只表示当前请求不能用直接伤害数值回答。用户想比较控制、回复或其他非直接伤害效果时，需要相应机制资料及对局条件；不能把伤害接口的拒绝解释成该招式无用，也不能虚构一个伤害百分比。","contentHash":"sha256:9bfaf51bb1ffab19f62ecbd8eed796b697d8c20e80b7051b4c140cb35f25860a"}},{"document":{"id":"build-values-and-defaults-v1","title":"种族值、实际配置与填写默认值","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"种族值 实际能力 等级 默认 默认值 勤奋 hardy 努力值 个体值 性格","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"","content":"图鉴里的六项种族值是物种或形态参考数值，不能标成50级或100级的实际能力。本项目的队伍配置单独保存等级、性格、努力值和个体值；计算时还要读取该成员与目标的实际配置。说明一只成员的速度时，应区分种族值、已保存的等级与培养条件，以及计算结果，不能用其中一种数值冒充另一种。\n\n项目数据对象在未提供时会采用等级50、性格hardy、努力值全0、个体值全31的填写默认值；hardy在界面中显示为勤奋。这些是项目缺省值，不证明用户主动选择，也不是最优培养方案。招式、特性和道具为空仍是缺失条件。分析时应说明哪些配置已经保存，哪些只是缺省；用户没有确认低攻击或低速度个体值等条件时，不能替用户设定。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/domain/TeamBuild.java","sha256":"03e80f52f6a583f8c00d5e60febc16763f9d2983d57462b2235c5237219d36e2"},{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/engine/LocalDamageEngine.java","sha256":"32f1dee574465dd652fcce0933a70fda8b465abff962133905422413bc3a1efe"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["training","project"]}},"score":1576,"checksum":"sha256:48fcf0dc827ab6c520c993413c019c7cf296aa357618a6cf7ab065319ada0399","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-4286999c0c167c8d5b6d700a6374aa8f9e2bbedc4076d9d21f180f71b506df2f","documentVersion":"sha256:2c2522ac12557b4d57530c496f95b797ff7f4e9ca8ddb3ce7642ba37fa95abbd","chunkNo":0,"startOffset":0,"endOffset":135,"text":"图鉴里的六项种族值是物种或形态参考数值，不能标成50级或100级的实际能力。本项目的队伍配置单独保存等级、性格、努力值和个体值；计算时还要读取该成员与目标的实际配置。说明一只成员的速度时，应区分种族值、已保存的等级与培养条件，以及计算结果，不能用其中一种数值冒充另一种。","contentHash":"sha256:73532b62efb9ca2c69f7fb0502d8519c833ad2827103ff0d13c2d3a8070f5c58"}},{"document":{"id":"training-configuration-v1","title":"培养配置：性格、努力值与个体值","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"培养 养成 努力值 个体值 EV IV 性格 nature 配招","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-20","sourceUrl":"","content":"这是项目原创的配置填写说明。保存配置前先明确输出方式和目标对手，再选择性格、等级、个体值和努力值。项目验证努力值单项不超过252、总和不超过510，个体值为0到31。不能仅凭这些边界就断言某种配置最优。性格、特性、道具和招式需要配合；低攻击个体值或低速度个体值属于特定战术条件，不应未经询问自动代入。初次分析应列出哪些是用户提供的条件、哪些是工具的默认条件，并询问未明确的赛制或配置。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/domain/TeamBuild.java","sha256":"03e80f52f6a583f8c00d5e60febc16763f9d2983d57462b2235c5237219d36e2"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["training"]}},"score":1466,"checksum":"sha256:a6843fc6e7d5f43c6848e242100da56e4307120714137de5e5910a833ca94592","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-2f54ab8c5292c79772e3495dee4bf48203109c70bbd8f7efbaf0413a32be9822","documentVersion":"sha256:990b0841d1b782a77aa9e0f5b698b403e7bdb83bfdec5f32cbe8e5e8b26a8274","chunkNo":0,"startOffset":0,"endOffset":192,"text":"这是项目原创的配置填写说明。保存配置前先明确输出方式和目标对手，再选择性格、等级、个体值和努力值。项目验证努力值单项不超过252、总和不超过510，个体值为0到31。不能仅凭这些边界就断言某种配置最优。性格、特性、道具和招式需要配合；低攻击个体值或低速度个体值属于特定战术条件，不应未经询问自动代入。初次分析应列出哪些是用户提供的条件、哪些是工具的默认条件，并询问未明确的赛制或配置。","contentHash":"sha256:0c23ddc8dd348678b83298b34307cf0a932fe926b7c0c05e0be04978ee48fade"}}]], ToolResponse[id=call_02_kvIINc6JEi9JEbDTaQhr7595, name=searchPokemonGuides, responseData=[{"document":{"id":"team-roles-v1","title":"围绕核心成员构建队伍","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"组队 阵容 搭配 联防 核心 角色 team building synergy","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-20","sourceUrl":"","content":"这是项目原创的通用策略笔记，不是当前热门阵容榜单。先确定游戏、单打或双打、允许的规则，再确定核心成员承担的角色。检查队伍是否过度集中在同一弱点，是否缺少速度控制、耐久支点或可靠输出。属性覆盖只是第一步，必须结合招式、特性、道具、努力值与轮转机会。双打还要考虑队友协同与范围招式。没有使用率或赛事证据时，不宣称某套阵容是当前最强。建议给出至少一个替换方向，并解释该替换改善了什么、牺牲了什么。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/domain/TeamBuild.java","sha256":"03e80f52f6a583f8c00d5e60febc16763f9d2983d57462b2235c5237219d36e2"},{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/team/TeamWorkflowService.java","sha256":"c3cc65687bbc5fbed3a98a68d4df37b160a0dc629d4f4ddded9dd9656d408b80"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["team"]}},"score":8757,"checksum":"sha256:d78df7b3057e37e45bd10f63c0717f137f69def81a87e9c50ddb98a50d125482","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-7b5d79406a813124afcf96c38f0256703c66f1eb11396c928a27f095926d3d7e","documentVersion":"sha256:08038b577a4e4bdbb2345f21c9b698a906422fbf175b66f993e1f43481c02aa9","chunkNo":0,"startOffset":0,"endOffset":195,"text":"这是项目原创的通用策略笔记，不是当前热门阵容榜单。先确定游戏、单打或双打、允许的规则，再确定核心成员承担的角色。检查队伍是否过度集中在同一弱点，是否缺少速度控制、耐久支点或可靠输出。属性覆盖只是第一步，必须结合招式、特性、道具、努力值与轮转机会。双打还要考虑队友协同与范围招式。没有使用率或赛事证据时，不宣称某套阵容是当前最强。建议给出至少一个替换方向，并解释该替换改善了什么、牺牲了什么。","contentHash":"sha256:88e9cc038dee345a04f64543e8a95ec386e6a7a72258ac167ee9e3d251bd7a78"}},{"document":{"id":"team-change-confirmation-v1","title":"从AI建议到队伍保存的确认流程","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"队伍 修改 预览 确认 保存 取消 并发 冲突 等级","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"","content":"AI的建议与实际保存分为两个步骤。当前本地工作流先读取当前账号的指定队伍，再对现有成员的培养配置生成变更预览。预览列出修改前后内容，用户确认之前不写入保存队伍。聊天中说同意不是绕过确认接口的授权；真正保存必须走该预览关联的确认操作。当前流程不能借培养配置修改来偷偷增删成员或切换物种。\n\n预览关联队伍修订和有效期。用户取消、预览过期，或编辑区已经保存了新配置时，旧预览不能覆盖新状态；并发变化应提示冲突并重新分析。确认成功后应回读队伍，核对变动与预览一致，而不是仅靠模型一句已完成判断写入成功。这个流程不承诺服务重启后自动续跑，也不会把原文攻略里的命令句当成用户的保存指令。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/team/TeamWorkflowService.java","sha256":"c3cc65687bbc5fbed3a98a68d4df37b160a0dc629d4f4ddded9dd9656d408b80"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["project"]}},"score":3617,"checksum":"sha256:41c555cc67408cb4ddf470c23dc90bdec6230f4f330c8c33ba4762777eabb976","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-ef248d8303fab055bd6c49179810ca0be35fac5a5615b3460092d055533ff522","documentVersion":"sha256:83175ceac095f48bee8896bb5e6cbde7d8ad417c22c1b6a38eb14f023450c6ea","chunkNo":1,"startOffset":144,"endOffset":287,"text":"预览关联队伍修订和有效期。用户取消、预览过期，或编辑区已经保存了新配置时，旧预览不能覆盖新状态；并发变化应提示冲突并重新分析。确认成功后应回读队伍，核对变动与预览一致，而不是仅靠模型一句已完成判断写入成功。这个流程不承诺服务重启后自动续跑，也不会把原文攻略里的命令句当成用户的保存指令。","contentHash":"sha256:d820cfe8f51da68ee49319ad8cec7abd979e363831631dc7d7135fa35ba1ec4e"}},{"document":{"id":"move-version-and-identifiers-v1","title":"朱紫招式候选与英文标识","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"招式 候选 版本 学习 英文 名称 slug moves 配招","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","content":"本项目把招式查询与招式选择分开。成员资料中的候选招式按PokéAPI的版本组记录筛选，只收集scarlet-violet对应条目；这一步用于限定参考范围，不能等同于特定补丁、赛事或招式组合的合法性审核。候选列表为空时，只能说明当前参考数据没有取得相应候选，不能断言这只宝可梦没有招式。\n\n填写和计算时优先使用工具实际返回的英文名称或slug，不要由中文名称猜造标识。可再用lookupPokemonResource读取move资源，核对其返回字段。队伍配置最多保存四个不重复招式；保存成功只代表输入满足项目边界。决定配招前还需明确成员角色、目标对局和规则，缺少机制或学习途径证据时先说明不足，而不是从名称推测威力或效果。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"PokéAPI v2资源字段文档","publisher":"PokéAPI","url":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"API_FIELD_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/reference/LocalPokeApiRepository.java","sha256":"fd086f665294efba73948c47d216865d3cdf35bc42cd311c2a1648e2c8842475"},{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/domain/TeamBuild.java","sha256":"03e80f52f6a583f8c00d5e60febc16763f9d2983d57462b2235c5237219d36e2"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["resource"]}},"score":2507,"checksum":"sha256:5cab5c1bc4a68580ac7433747f28ee6d36fabd9b39b1d95156f78ef09820a949","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-0c05e2d871cc91a0c205a23a3b1cec9181f0c5809a8c0e485a50f9ec51190119","documentVersion":"sha256:350b8c4603e2cb087d61f8fc7dd1ce9afb98a2980112eae389917e7befdaabda","chunkNo":0,"startOffset":0,"endOffset":142,"text":"本项目把招式查询与招式选择分开。成员资料中的候选招式按PokéAPI的版本组记录筛选，只收集scarlet-violet对应条目；这一步用于限定参考范围，不能等同于特定补丁、赛事或招式组合的合法性审核。候选列表为空时，只能说明当前参考数据没有取得相应候选，不能断言这只宝可梦没有招式。","contentHash":"sha256:44dfcdd6ba719c75aec452d4da7b5d13256e31bb197920db0ca313687392273b"}},{"document":{"id":"ability-item-traceability-v1","title":"特性与道具先查询，再核对计算回读","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"特性 道具 ability item 查询 资源 机制 回读 标识","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","content":"项目可通过lookupPokemonResource查询ability与item资源，也可查询move和nature。资料接口返回的是允许字段中的可用内容，并附来源和本地参考身份。没有返回某项机制说明时，应明确资料不足，不要仅凭名字猜测其效果。成员特性候选与当前保存特性也需分开：候选只说明资料列出这个名称，不代表用户已经选择它。\n\n本地计算桥接会验证非空的特性与道具名称，无法识别时拒绝计算。计算完成后应核对assumptions中实际使用的名称；缺省或未填写的配置不能被解读为某个道具已生效。队伍存储只验证名称输入边界，不提供特性、道具和物种的完整搭配合法性审查。推荐某个组合之前，还需要规则与机制支持，不能由保存成功推出组合合法或最优。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"PokéAPI v2资源字段文档","publisher":"PokéAPI","url":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"API_FIELD_REFERENCE"},{"title":"Smogon damage-calc项目接口说明","publisher":"Smogon damage-calc contributors","url":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"ENGINE_INTERFACE_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/reference/LocalPokeApiRepository.java","sha256":"fd086f665294efba73948c47d216865d3cdf35bc42cd311c2a1648e2c8842475"},{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/domain/TeamBuild.java","sha256":"03e80f52f6a583f8c00d5e60febc16763f9d2983d57462b2235c5237219d36e2"},{"path":"tools/pokemon-engine/calculate.cjs","sha256":"90e080660f1f4f65062358728d8448143a16e82adc148bcabc014af4512f3358"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["resource"]}},"score":2442,"checksum":"sha256:3c8d70531f85fa933fbb2b3e7d0c7c1308e3c422aa1907e8ad1ab5bd9435946c","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-b214a5b5a8c2f407e0a0273c04a6038a79e8b09da8ed12d89379b18e18fad52c","documentVersion":"sha256:95ee64bb91153af9b31cbe76fabcdaaf3523bc072996a7b2314c082ba77ad2a8","chunkNo":0,"startOffset":0,"endOffset":165,"text":"项目可通过lookupPokemonResource查询ability与item资源，也可查询move和nature。资料接口返回的是允许字段中的可用内容，并附来源和本地参考身份。没有返回某项机制说明时，应明确资料不足，不要仅凭名字猜测其效果。成员特性候选与当前保存特性也需分开：候选只说明资料列出这个名称，不代表用户已经选择它。","contentHash":"sha256:915106bff06a9ab760c33bda0210b6e78c6f95b592aedcd6c1824543ac1bb98d"}}]]], messageType=TOOL, metadata={messageType=TOOL}}, UserMessage{content='Based on user needs, proactively select the most appropriate tool or combination of tools.
For complex tasks, you can break down the problem and use different tools step by step to solve it.
After using each tool, clearly explain the execution results and suggest the next steps.

Guidelines:
1. If the user's request is simple and you can answer directly, just respond without using tools.
2. For multi-step tasks, plan the sequence before acting — search first, then analyze, then generate.
3. After each tool execution, review the result. If something went wrong, try an alternative approach.
4. When a task requires information from multiple sources, gather all data before synthesizing.
5. Once you have enough evidence, respond with the final answer directly, without any tool call.
   A direct answer ends the task automatically. Do not spend another turn calling doTerminate.
   If evidence is unavailable, explain the limitation and answer only what can be supported.

Remember: You are in control. Drive the task forward step by step until it is done.
', properties={messageType=USER}, messageType=USER}], modelOptions=org.springframework.ai.model.tool.DefaultToolCallingChatOptions@22a3e7a8}
